rs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a></b>: kill at range. Don't get too close or in the way of the waves and beams.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Draken\">Draken</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chizzoron%20the%20Distorter\">Chizzoron the Distorter</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonking%20Zyrtarch\">Dragonking Zyrtarch</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Abomination\">Draken Abomination</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Elite\">Draken Elite</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Spellweaver\">Draken Spellweaver</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Warmaster\">Draken Warmaster</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Paiz%20the%20Pauperizer\">Paiz the Pauperizer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20of%20Dragonking%20Zyrtarch\">Soul of Dragonking Zyrtarch</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zulazza%20the%20Corruptor\">Zulazza the Corruptor</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["the-new-frontier-quest"]}